# Search config for THIS repo only (ripgrep / fd / telescope read .ignore).
#
# Everything this repo holds lives in dotfiles and dotdirs — .config, .pi, .librewolf,
# .bashrc, .inputrc — which rg and fd skip by default, so an unqualified search here
# returned nothing at all. Un-hide them, then put .git back: negating .* alone drags in
# ~690 files of git internals. Scoped to this directory tree; searches elsewhere on the
# machine are unaffected.
!.*
.git/
